4439:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****         /*
4440:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * PLEASE NOTE:
4441:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          *
4442:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * This function is provided for convenience only, and is used by many
4443:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * of the demo applications.  Do not consider it to be part of the
4444:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * scheduler.
4445:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          *
4446:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * vTaskList() calls uxTaskGetSystemState(), then formats part of the
4447:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * uxTaskGetSystemState() output into a human readable table that
4448:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * displays task: names, states, priority, stack usage and task number.
4449:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * Stack usage specified as the number of unused StackType_t words stack can hold
4450:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * on top of stack - not the number of bytes.
4451:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          *
4452:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * vTaskList() has a dependency on the sprintf() C library function that
4453:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * might bloat the code size, use a lot of stack, and provide different
4454:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * results on different platforms.  An alternative, tiny, third party,
4455:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * and limited functionality implementation of sprintf() is provided in
4456:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * many of the FreeRTOS/Demo sub-directories in a file called
4457:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * printf-stdarg.c (note printf-stdarg.c does not provide a full
4458:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * snprintf() implementation!).
4459:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          *
4460:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * It is recommended that production systems call uxTaskGetSystemState()
4461:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * directly to get access to raw stats data, rather than indirectly
4462:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          * through a call to vTaskList().
4463:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****          */
4464:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c **** 
4465:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c **** 
4466:Middlewares/Third_Party/FreeRTOS/Source/tasks.c ****         /* Make sure the write buffer does not contain a string. */
